---
title: Templates and custom components
author: a penguin
---

Templates wrap a document and can swap markdown elements for components.
They are configured in `mdsvex.config.json`, the same shape as the vite
plugin options.

## How it works

- every frontmatter key reaches the template as a prop
- the body is passed as `children`
- the template's `<script module>` exports replace elements by name

This `h2` and the paragraphs come from `Template.svelte`, and the image
falls back to the root `components.js` module.

